  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "西班牙文(二)",
    "sub_ename": "SPANISH(2)",
    "describe_ch": "1. 透過與日常生活相關的對話和基礎文法概念的結合，引導學生吸收並理解西語詞彙和語意。\r\n2. 透過發音學習，培養學生可以正確發音與朗讀簡短文章之能力。\r\n3. 藉由基礎日常生活的會話，加強學生聽說的表達能力。\r\n4. 透過基礎西語的習得，讓學生可以進一步認識西班牙和拉丁美洲國家的風俗民情及文化。\r\n本學期的主題包括描述人物外表及個性、身體狀態、穿著、時間表達、日常活動、點餐等。於學期末學生能有效地運用的西班牙文進行日常生活基本的對話與溝通，並達到SFLPT 第二外語能力測驗（基礎級) PRE Al 程度。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "1.To train students to learn and understand the meanings of Spanish vocabulary and sentences with daily life conversations and concepts of grammar\r\n2.To build up students’ abilities to read out loud short articles with correct pronunciation\r\n3.To improve students’ abilities in speaking and listening with the practice of daily conversations\r\n4.To further understand the customs and culture of Spain and Latin America with the basic Spanish learned\r\nThe course includes the descriptions of people’s appearances and personalities, physical structures, \r\nclothes, time, ordinary activities, ordering meals, etc. At the end of the semester, students would be \r\nable to use Spanish to carry on a conversation and to communicate with others. Furthermore, \r\nstudents could be certified to pass the level of Pre-A1 in a SFLPT test.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "SPAN1001西班牙文(一)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "SPAN1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "SPAN1001 SPANISH(1)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
